## Description

The `knapsack` package implements algorithms for solving the 0/1 knapsack problem in R, including brute force search, dynamic programming, and greedy algorithms. It also provides an optimized implementation and a dataset for testing algorithm performance.

## Version 0.1.0

Initial release of the `knapsack` package.

## Installation

Install the package directly from GitHub:

```r
install.packages("remotes")
remotes::install_github("wenli420/lab6knapsack")
```

